      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.87,
      "end_seconds": 284.91,
      "duration_seconds": 17.04,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible ectopic pregnancy is my leading thought, not anything worse. Just to be sure I understood. You've had light vaginal bleeding, since last Tuesday, and no fever or vaginal discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.8,
      "end_seconds": 288.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "That's what happened, yes."
