      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.33,
      "end_seconds": 316.45,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "you need to go to the hospital now for an emergency scan come back straight away that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
